{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "- currentSpendUSD 是本月至今累计，不是当天花了多少" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- currentSpendUSD is the month-to-date total, not what was spent today"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- currentSpendUSD は今月の累計であり、その日の金額ではありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- periodStart 永远是当月 1 号，跨月要自动跟着变" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- periodStart is always the 1st of the current month, and must roll over automatically"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- periodStart は常に当月 1 日で、月が変わったら自動的に更新してください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 同一个月重复投递是覆盖，不会重复计账，失败重试是安全的" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- Reporting twice in the same month overwrites rather than double-counts, so retries are safe"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 同じ月に複数回送信しても上書きされ二重計上されないため、リトライは安全です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 每天跑一次就够" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- Running once a day is enough"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 1 日 1 回の実行で十分です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 金额必须是字符串，不要发 JSON number，分位不能丢" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- The amount must be a string, never a JSON number — cents must not be lost"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 金額は必ず文字列で送ってください。JSON の数値だと小数部が失われます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
